BCMath: arbitrary precision mathematics, numbers of any size and
precision as strings.

The module bcmath of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/bcmath.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its
headers in include/php81/php/ext/bcmath.
